{"id":"f0364f297bdbfa15","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-prefix-free-language.md","title":"语言的前缀性质","display":"df-prefix-free-language — 语言的前缀性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-prefix-free-language","aliases":["73-df-prefix-free-language"],"display":"df-prefix-free-language — 语言的前缀性质","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§10.7, Theorem 10.12, p. 260; scan 268","legacy_source_status":"book-based-local-formalization","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":6},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-prefix-free-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-prefix-free-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prefix-free-language — 语言的前缀性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§6.4, print pp. 252–257; PDF pp. 274–279; local DPDA closure/ambiguity interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§10.7, Theorem 10.12, p. 260; scan 268"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"6"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PrefixFree}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall u,v\\in L\\;[\\exists x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(v=ux)\\Longrightarrow u=v]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PrefixFree}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall u,v\\in L\\;[\\exists x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(v=ux)\\Longrightarrow u=v]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的前缀性质指任何成员都不是另一成员的真前缀。若语言含 ε，前缀无关就迫使它至多只有 ε 一个成员。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$，见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}prefix\\text{-}free\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PrefixFree}_{\\Sigma}(L)\\leftrightarrow\\forall u,v\\in L\\;[\\exists x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(v=ux)\\Longrightarrow u=v]","display":true}],"bytes":1364,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-prefix-free-language|语言的前缀性质]]"},{"id":"366c2e26a2b77ac2","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。DPDA/DCFL、前缀性质、空栈语言见 [[73-df-deterministic-pushdown-automaton]]、[[73-df-prefix-free-language]]、[[73-df-pda-empty-stack-semantics]]。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}